### TEST 1 - Upload Avatar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/files/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test.jpg
--MyBoundary--

